# Cost basis: preview and recalculation (README "Cost basis").
#
# Local test of the transfer cost fix, in this order:
#   1. Start the API with the current rule (Legacy, the default):  cd api/api && dotnet run
#   2. Log in, put the token (without "Bearer") in api/api/Requests/.env as DGI_TOKEN=... (git-ignored; never paste
#      it into this file), and set @cryptoAssetId to the BTC asset id
#      (from the asset page URL; create the BTC asset in the app first if needed).
#   3. Run "Buy 1 BTC at 60k", then "Withdraw 0.5 BTC". The asset page now shows the bug:
#      average price 120k, invested 60k.
#   4. Run "Preview": before = 120k / 60k (Legacy), after = 60k / 30k (Proportional). Nothing is saved.
#   5. Optional: restart the API with the fix and recalculation enabled,
#        CostBasisSettings__TransferCostPolicy=Proportional RecalculationSettings__EnableRecalculation=true dotnet run
#      then run "Recalculate" logged in as an admin. The asset page shows 60k / 30k.

@url-dev = http://localhost:5062/api
@url-stage = https://dginvest-stage-api-weu-01.azurewebsites.net/api
@token = {{$dotenv DGI_TOKEN}}
@cryptoAssetId = 0

### Buy 1 BTC at 60k
POST {{url-dev}}/Crypto/add-transaction
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "amount": 1,
    "price": 60000,
    "purchaseDate": "2026-11-08T12:00:00Z",
    "exchangeName": "Test",
    "transactionType": 1,
    "cryptoAssetId": {{cryptoAssetId}},
    "fee": 0
}

### Withdraw 0.5 BTC (crypto withdrawal, transactionType 6 = WithdrawCrypto; records a TransferOut)
POST {{url-dev}}/Account/withdraw-fund
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "amount": 0.5,
    "date": "2026-11-09T12:00:00Z",
    "notes": "Cost basis test: crypto withdrawal",
    "transactionType": 6,
    "currentPrice": 80000,
    "cryptoAssetId": "{{cryptoAssetId}}",
    "exchangeName": "Test"
}

### Preview: your own assets, figures today (before) vs. after switching to Proportional. Read-only.
GET {{url-dev}}/Recalculate/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preview in STAGE (use a STAGE token). Read-only, safe with real data.
GET {{url-stage}}/Recalculate/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recalculate every user's accounts. Admin only, and only when RecalculationSettings:EnableRecalculation is true.
POST {{url-dev}}/Recalculate/recalculate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
